  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞门打不开。\n　似乎上了锁……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_436.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 76 11}啊？\n又打不开啊？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_436.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 09}又得找钥匙吗。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_436.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3F 06}不……\n这扇门上，也没有找到\n像是锁孔的东西。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_436.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}应该又是解开谜题后，\n才能通过的机关。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_436.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}看来和一路上看到的\n笔记本暗号有关。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_436.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}来这里的路上，\n有些像是暗号的东西。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_436.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}要不要再找找\n其他能当线索的东西？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_436.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}如果像上一层那样，\n是按顺序穿门的机关……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_436.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这里打不开，\n也就是说……\n顺序弄错了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_436.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞门打不开。\n　看来通过的顺序不对……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_436.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞门打不开。\n　看来通过的顺序不对……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_436.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}穿过这扇门后方的那扇门后，\n按{F2 01 03 01}左、左、左、后、右、后、左{F2 01 01 01}……\n这个顺序穿过各扇门吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
